{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"some","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of its IDs.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"remote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deletedIDs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"remote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absence means nothing."}]}]},{"name":"deletedIDs","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that "},{"code":"remote","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still holds is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" removed however it is named here: a live row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale."}]}]},{"name":"preserving","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as in the full reconcile. "},{"code":"remote","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has no authority over them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does "},{"code":"deletedIDs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". This store’s own un-drained "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"folded in automatically."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes is where deletions come from.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A partial snapshot ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cannot"}]},{"text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entirely by ","type":"text"},{"code":"deletedIDs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which the caller must have positive evidence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swidux","title":"Swidux","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/changes":{"title":"changes","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accumulated changes since the last "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resetChanges()"},{"text":" call.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"changes","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux9ChangeSetV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChangeSet"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/changes"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"fu